# W30b, b (k10, last Security Gate dng205b2): the lobby's return mat puts it on dng205b2, where a's instance never was: a NEW
# of its own (I1a; I1b shows a's row greyed "Story not here yet"); home again, and after a reached dng205b2 the next
# arrival there joins a without leaving a's story.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@200
explore mate02 yes until stage=dng205b2,control
log b alone on dng205b2
idle until frames>=300 fail present>=2
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@320
explore mate02 yes until stage=dng205b2,control
wander 0 0 30 until present=2,sealed>=600 fail epoch>=@620
log b joined a on dng205b2
